## Cause read from the tests

The first Actions run on PR #43 failed at `bash tests/spec_review_gate/run.sh`. Two checks read commits with `git cat-file -e <sha>:<path>`: test_s1_new_track.sh line 161 reads 7d72b40665074a89f5be606935cad94a1ef1e4e9, and test_s2_role_docs.sh lines 262-263 read ccdaae22a965f06c64ecde9f735a1ed49db3ce5e and short 25b9064. `actions/checkout@v4` fetched one commit only, so those objects were absent. No tag or branch is needed; full history is enough.

